  Spanish terms (archivo, carpeta, Configuración, equipo); "vídeo" as Windows and the Store write it in es-ES. UI labels
  named inside a sentence stand in quotation marks (“…”). Spanish needs no _many form here: with digits a million takes
  no "de" ("1.000.000 fotos"), so every sentence is the same as _other.
-->
